# ==========================================================================
#  ayushrijal.com.np — environment template
# ==========================================================================
#  Copy to `.env` for local work. `.env` is gitignored and MUST NOT be
#  committed. Nothing in here is required to run `npm run dev` or
#  `npm run build` — the site builds with no secrets at all, and falls back to
#  the committed GitHub snapshot. See docs/SECURITY.md.
# ==========================================================================

# Optional. A GitHub fine-grained PAT with PUBLIC READ-ONLY access, used only
# to raise the local rate limit while developing the build-time fetch.
# In CI this is never set by hand — Actions injects its own GITHUB_TOKEN.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Override the account whose public repositories are compiled into the site.
# GITHUB_LOGIN=ayushrijal83-ops
